    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale this Detached Bungalow on 0.75 Acre Site with Stunning Lough Views\nSet on an impressive 0.75-acre site in a scenic and peaceful rural location, this detached bungalow enjoys beautiful views over Drongawn Lough and the surrounding lush countryside.\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation comprising an entrance hallway, comfortable living room, kitchen/dining area and utility room. There are four bedrooms, including one ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\nExternally, the property benefits from a detached garage and generous grounds, providing ample space and excellent potential for outdoor enjoyment.\nIdeally situated in a tranquil countryside setting on the Island, the property remains within easy commuting distance of the surrounding villages and towns, making it an attractive option for those seeking a peaceful rural lifestyle without being too far from local amenities and transport links."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.0 x 2.0\nWooden flooring. Cloak room and hot press. Coving and centre ceiling rose.\n\nLiving Room - 7.5 x 3.5\nWooden flooring. Marble fireplace with granite hearth. Double aspect room promoting natural light. Coving and centre ceiling rose.\n\nKitchen/Dining area - 5.8 x 3.5\nWoodgrain effect tiled flooring. Eye and low level units with Quartz worktop, double drainer sink and tiled splash back. Fitted double range oven with gas hob and overhead extractor fan. Integrated dishwasher.\n\nUtility Room - 2.6 x 2.2\nWoodgrain effect tiled flooring. Low level units. Plumbed for washing machine, tumble dryer. Door to rear of property.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.5 x 3.3\nLaminated timber flooring. Fitted floor to ceiling mirrored sliderobes.\n\nEnsuite - 2.0 x 1.0\nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3 x 2.6\nLaminated timber flooring. Fitted floor to ceiling mirrored sliderobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2 x 2.8\nLaminated timber flooring. Fitted floor to ceiling mirrored sliderobes.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.3 x 2.8\nLaminated timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.2 x 2.2\nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and Jacuzzi bath with overhead shower.\n\nDetached Garage - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Detached Bungalow</li><li>Constructed 1990</li><li>Total Floor area 126 sq m</li><li>Detached garage to rear</li><li>Scenic area with views of Drongawn Lough</li><li>Comprising 4 bedrooms, 1 of which is ensuite</li><li>Presented in excellent condition internally</li><li>Occupying 0.30 hectares (0.75 acre) site</li><li>Landscaped gardens to front side and rear of property.</li><li>Tar mac driveway and apron.</li><li>Located in a scenic rural area</ul>"
      },
